OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABloodied, dazed and angry - how
OL,4,Apassengers' rail journey turned to
OL,5,Adisaster in Spain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThen the impossible happened, Spain's
OL,8,Ftransport minister said, as the Renfe
OL,9,Ftrain was ordered to proceed in
OL,10,F"error".
OL,12,FIt crashed into the back of the other
OL,13,Ftrain between municipalities Mora and
OL,14,FOrgaz, about 140km (87 miles) south of
OL,15,FMadrid.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
